<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Juan Minetti 9-month net $9 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Juan Minetti 9-month net $9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to September 30. Net $9 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: the company did not provide comparatives, revenues or earnings per share, or third quarter results.</p>
<p>At September 30 its net worth stood at $252.9 million. The firm reported retained earnings of $51.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
